SUMMARY:Foundations of Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260224T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260224T223000
UID:063f784063afcd4cf9f745e6@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Our mind is notoriously tricky - hard to manage\, mostly uncon
 scious\, creative and destructive by degrees. What’s crucial is to be ab
 le to work with this tricky ‘non-thing’ called the mind. Buddhism has 
 2\,500 years of experience working with the mind. In this sense\, meditati
 on is at the heart of Buddhism.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/foundations-of-meditatio
 n-course-feb-2026
END:VEVENT
